<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21469" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">illăcrĭmābĭlis</span></b> 
			(<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inl-</span></b> ),
		e, adj.
		in-lacrimabilis. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Unwept</i>, <i>unlamented</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκλαυστος</span>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sed omnes illacrimabiles Urgentur ignotique
					longa Nocte,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					C. 4, 9, 26</span></i>
			 (cf. indefletus, <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 7,
			611</span></i>).—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>That is not</i> or <i>cannot be moved
				by tears</i>, <i>pitiless</i>, <i>inexorable</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Pluto,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					C. 2, 14, 6</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">urna,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Aus. Epit. 36, 3</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
